---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="DMCA — Rent Free News">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <div class="kicker text-brand-600">Trust</div>
    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-[36px] tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1">DMCA policy</h1>
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert font-serif mt-4">
      <p>Rent Free News publishes original reporting, analysis, and embeds used with permission or under fair use with attribution and a link to the original. We do not rehost full articles, paywalled stories, or third-party video files.</p>
      <p>If you believe content on this site infringes your copyright, email <a href="mailto:desk@rentfreenews.com">desk@rentfreenews.com</a> with: (1) your contact details, (2) the exact URL of the material, (3) identification of the work, and (4) a good-faith statement that the use is not authorized.</p>
      <p>We aim to respond within 48 hours. Valid claims are removed or linked corrected the same day. Counter-notices follow the same inbox.</p>
      <p>Prefer a link update or credit fix? Use the same address — most issues are one reply, not a takedown.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
